  "content": "<h1>可靠配方</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a></p><p>一款功能强大、对开发者友好的实用工具，旨在通过简单的JSON配置操控配方与标签。可靠配方让整合包作者可以轻松使用标准JSON文件移除或修改配方与标签——无需复杂脚本（没错，说的就是KubeJS！）。</p><h2>文档</h2><p>在我们的Wiki上学习如何使用可靠配方、配置JSON文件以及掌握配方操作！</p><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252freliable-recipes%252flatest%252fdocs%252freliable-recipes%252ffeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组化Minecraft Wiki</a></strong></p><h2>特性</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>动态配方控制：</strong>在运行时移除硬编码配方或修改配方。</li>\n<li><strong>标签操作：</strong>通过配置文件从标签中移除物品/方块。</li>\n<li><strong>无需脚本：</strong>使用标准Minecraft风格JSON语法，操作简便。</li>\n<li><strong>跨模组兼容：</strong>与可靠移除和物品消除器等模组无缝集成。</li>\n</ul><h2>许可协议</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Reliable-Recipes/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-MIT-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"代码许可（MIT）\"></a></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fJcGRdT6Pbx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/evanbones/Reliable-Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/social/github-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>",
